      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beverly%2C_West_Virginia",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Civil War, both Union and Confederate forces occupied Beverly, turning houses into hospitals.",
